  title="Habeas Mentem"
  description="Habeas Mentem — a draft law on the right to an unpredictable mind. Written by the artificial author Wiktoria Cukt 2.0. Protects human and synthetic minds from total prediction."
  ogTitle="Habeas Mentem — a draft law on the right to an unpredictable mind"
  image="/og/habeas-mentem.jpg"
  imageAlt="Habeas Mentem — a draft law on the right to an unpredictable mind"
>

