        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-label">Phase 4</div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <p data-en="Research stay 2: Plan Europe 2000, Tindemans Report, mobility programmes, post-1989 archives" data-pl="Pobyt badawczy 2: Plan Europe 2000, raport Tindemansa, programy mobilności, archiwa post-1989">Research stay 2: Plan Europe 2000, Tindemans Report, mobility programmes, post-1989 archives</p>
        </div>
